    "text": "Let the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>)</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;represent circles of varying radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>]</mo><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;Then the number of elements in the set <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo></math>{<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi></math> is an integer} is ___________"
  },
